  _dialogue:
  - speakerName: Maria
    sentences:
    - 'Hello, can you help me find my five children? '
    - I know they are nearby but I can't find them, please.
  - speakerName: Maria
    sentences:
    - Thank you for helping, you are missing five of my children.
  - speakerName: Maria
    sentences:
    - Thank you, there are four more children arround here.
  - speakerName: Maria
    sentences:
    - Thanks. I'm missing three more children.
  - speakerName: Maria
    sentences:
    - You are doing great, you need to find two more.
  - speakerName: Maria
    sentences:
    - You are almost there, one more my friend.
  - speakerName: Maria
    sentences:
    - Oh breadcrums! You found all of my babies.
    - I'm so happy, take this.
  - speakerName: Maria
    sentences:
    - Thank you again little hero.
